r.mu.Unlock()\n97|\treturn len(runner.calls)\n98|}\n99|\n100|func successResult(t *testing.T, id, body string) Result {\n101|\tt.Helper()\n102|\treturn Result{Stdout: successFrame(t, id, body), ExitCode: 0}\n103|}\n104|\n(more lines below)"}}}
