rvivors\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"M01-ops-order exit 1\\nM02-caps-order exit 1\\ntree True 9be629df07fcb6ff27591b143b50125352edf70ee34ea1d6f5c7f6f84167c6b6\\n{'M01-ops-order': 1, 'M02-caps-order': 1}\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 160,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 40,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}"}}}
