{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000dba9","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a06f86-1896-77b0-a64d-49a48c76fe78"},"sequence":3119,"recorded_at":1780531400006233,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"3bc73467-9e0e-4b04-8606-b581be737d17","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"3bc73467-9e0e-4b04-8606-b581be737d17","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"3bc73467-9e0e-4b04-8606-b581be737d17"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"890e5161-9352-48dc-820a-b83280b20ba1"},"task_id":"890e5161-9352-48dc-820a-b83280b20ba1","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"890e5161-9352-48dc-820a-b83280b20ba1","chunk":"Read text file `LOGBOOK.md`.\n1|# Flight Logbook\n2|\n3|> Institutional memory. Concise, factual, high-signal.\n4|> Newest entries first. One block per insight.\n5|\n6|## 2026-09-05\n7|\n8|### 0435 — Provider JSONL host leaf round-2 rework: arm identity, exact bounds, production-site pins\n9|\n10|- SCOPE: TASK-260830-qcosxq round-1 verdict (changes requested, 44/66 killed, 18 real survivors). Test-only rework in `internal/provhost` plus README/LOGBOOK honesty items; production untouched. Uncommitted per the CR-shape instruction.\n11|- FIX (F25, structural, first): every refusal row now names its arm — `requireFrameRefusal` (code + `member` detail + rule detail + non-retryable) for frame refusals, `requireLocalRefusal` (code + rule detail + non-retryable) for invalid_config/integrity/timeout/process arms, plus `observed`-version assertions on both mismatch paths and `status_state` on unknown. Zero code-only refusal rows remain outside the two helpers, the bound-child surfacing check, and mismatch checks paired with identity assertions. Matches the sibling leaf's 0/29 → all-asserted shape.\n12|- FIX (F21): five foreign-major malformed versions (`3.0`, `3.0.0.0`, `.0.0`, `3..0`, `3.b.c`) asserting `provider_protocol_error`; each of the four deleted `parseMajor` arms now promotes its shape to `incompatible_protocol` and reddens.\n(more lines below)"}}}
